<title>UK: Capital Radio to book 1.25 mln stg gain.</title>
<headline>Capital Radio to book 1.25 mln stg gain.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Capital Radio Plc said on Monday it expected an exceptional profit of around 1.25 million stg on the sale of its stake in Radio Wyvern to GWR Group Plc.</p>
<p>Capital held 35 percent of the capital of Radio Wyvern. GWR agreed last December to buy the company for some 3.9 million stg.</p>
<p>The gain will feature in Capital's interim results for the six months to March 1997. These figures will be released on May 15. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
